# Carmilla, Shadow of Twilight

> Carmilla is not a crowd control support, she is a crowd control multiplier. Her ultimate links enemies together, so a stun or knockback that lands on one enemy lands on them all, and burst damage rolls across the chain. The hero only works when the enemy draft gives you that chain to link.

