## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-15. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Favor CC Link (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when a burst mage can remove Carmilla before she links the backline with Curse of Blood.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic poke or burn that chips Carmilla before objective fights.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when physical skill burst from assassins or fighters reaches Carmilla during her Crimson Flower channel.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use when recalls are costing map control and the enemy cannot instantly punish the missing revive.
- Total cost: 10590 gold

Default ranked roam setup built around Favor, Flask, Fleeting Time, and Dominance Ice so Carmilla can survive mid-fight, steal defenses with Crimson Flower, and link as many enemies as possible with Curse of Blood.

### Roam Encourage Frontline (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Oracle over Antique Cuirass when Use when the enemy has multiple mages or magic damage dealers and physical burst is not the primary threat.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the enemy marksman is the main damage source and Carmilla needs to reflect basic attacks while holding the frontline.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use when one magic burst combo can delete Carmilla before she can apply her passive heal.; Cursed Helmet over Immortality when Use when the enemy clusters for Curse of Blood and the burn aura adds meaningful damage during extended brawls.
- Total cost: 10690 gold

Tankier frontline setup for drafts that need Encourage speed and Carmilla to absorb damage while repeatedly stealing defenses and applying Thunder Belt enhanced basic attacks in close range.

### Roam Purify Sustain (Roam)

